# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

~> **Note:** This resource is behind a feature flag. Set the environment variable `YBM_FF_AMP=true` to use it.

The environment's agent must have enrolled before a cluster can be created in it. An apply that creates the cluster fails immediately while the environment is still `PENDING`; install the agent with the environment's `install_hint` and apply again.

Updating `cpu`, `memory` or `allowed_cidrs` changes the cluster in place. Changing `environment_id`, `cluster_name`, `pg_version`, `engine`, `extensions` or `connectivity_mode` replaces the cluster, which deletes its data. `password` cannot be changed after creation.

